    {
      "id": "fd2e4b38f6789f5e732896e43621ee3b6e1d3829111001ca7a42136360c89432",
      "text": "and others have built hooks to integrate with it. And I expect many more to come.",
      "hash": "204e0da4b7804c482b1dd99fa668fb2d3d6b4b9bc649067f135f927b1b865b63"
    },
    {
      "id": "725ee76c3afaa75228c5326a4db2bf66b11c8b445dbd3bf985864da27bea0356",
      "text": "All of that adds up to saved time, saved energy, saved money, saved hassle — more freedom, more fun, and more time to spend making",
      "hash": "d83de268a35135f440f308aa9b42c54ce4556f7d5bd0bc26cc541ef44ca4aa51"
    },
    {
