    },
    {
      "id": "b2144c8c10d15d755896c03598bc9543336afc71b5a60a982e9e1907e829f619",
      "text": "AI SDK v6 makes LLM-powered apps as modern as the rest of app development. Finally!",
      "hash": "50e41462c5338a53d22b5ad72aadee18e75f9ac88c97ac68903cf8f3eddad641"
    },
    {
      "id": "52d7305a9deffb1237b3c0a9643d98611234e069d62ff6bf25d72d10ae3734b1",
      "text": "Don't you want this for yourself and your projects?",
      "hash": "353d114d4f5539bfd8291b0b524d3824192417b1cfa5fcf5a41b99cf609c16b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "693205341f8beff3106663d3805f693a27d5af382bc19b50f5dd5fb2426d5f5c",
      "text": "It can be yours. And with the Crash Course, it won't take long to get there.",
